Package: reporter
Type: Package
Title: Modular Automated HTML Reporting for Bioinformatics Pipelines
Version: 0.1.0
Authors@R: c(
    person("xu", "fa", , "BioLaoXu@users.noreply.github.com", role = c("aut", "cre")),
    person("Origene", "BioInfoTeam", , "BioLaoXu@users.noreply.github.com", role = "aut")
  )
Description: A modular, automated reporting framework for standard
    bioinformatics analysis results. A report is assembled from plain R
    functions (modules) that consume a report context (result directory,
    project metadata, auto figure/table numbering) and return
    'htmltools' tag fragments. Rendering produces a single
    self-contained HTML file (CSS/JS inlined, images base64 encoded)
    with a fixed top navbar, a sidebar table of contents with
    scroll-synced highlighting, and switchable brand themes.
